      "issue": "P3.4 (ADDED) is the masking-differential motivation for H1a -- the cash>stock attenuation/by-product reasoning deferred from 2.1 P5 -- i.e. a masking leg asserted in 2.2 that depends on its setup in 2.1 P5 (Shleifer-Vishny currency motive / Louis pre-deal earnings / thewissen tone). Unlike every sibling in 2.2 P3 (P3.1/P3.2/P3.3 each carry relation_to_2_1 + anchor_2_1=['P5'], P3.3=['P5','P7']), P3.4 omits both fields. The setup link survives only in the free-text verification.note, so an orchestrator that traces the structured anchor graph will not see this masking leg's dependency on its 2.1 setup.",
